{"4683260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Project Rabbit", "steam_appid": 4683260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683260/extras/67b35612fa577aa56c13197850d776d1.avif?t=1787821436\" alt=\"Project Rabbit is a next-gen hardcore PC action game blending high-risk  Extraction mechanics with deep Soul-like combat.   Reimagining Alice in Wonderland as an East-meets-West dark fantasy  enriched by a proven Webtoon IP, it builds a unique universe for global audiences.   Driven by meticulously balanced action and strategic looting,  it delivers unparalleled immersion and endless replayability,  aiming to set a new benchmark in the proven hardcore gaming market.\" width=1368 height=1058 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Follow Alice into the abyss.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Project Rabbit</i> is a multiplayer Soul-like action game that reimagines <i>Alice in Wonderland</i> as a dark fantasy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight, explore, and survive within the twisted abyss of time. Will you escape the madness, or be consumed by it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683260/extras/0bab360ae8a61abf1cbb1d1b593027b0.avif?t=1787821436\" width=1368 height=362 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>[Into the Abyss of Time]</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the power of dimensions collapsed, continents from different realms became entangled into a single world, and within the cracks between them, the “Abyss of Time” was born.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Abyss is a twisted world sealed away by the Blood Queen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within it wander beings that neither age nor die, trapped in an endless cycle of time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those who survived the darkness of the Abyss built the last refuge beneath a fading barrier of light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the barrier is slowly losing its power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, someone must once again step into the Abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you survive the madness consuming the Abyss of Time alongside Alice?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683260/extras/bc0e4bf6801e360d54ea93399d8d8dd1.avif?t=1787821436\" width=1368 height=362 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>[Forge Your Own Way to Fight the Madness]</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within the Abyss of Time, even the smallest mistake can lead to a fatal end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use dodges, parries, and a variety of combat skills to battle against beings consumed by madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden treasures and forgotten secrets buried deep within the Abyss, and forge your own combat style through countless combinations of weapons, equipment, and skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683260/extras/93dbde4cb28fc4e0dd8fd6a46c66b36f.avif?t=1787821436\" width=1368 height=362 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>[Explore the Abyss Together — And Return Alive]</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into the dangerous Abyss of Time alone, or alongside your allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within the Abyss, it is not only creatures consumed by madness that await you, but also unpredictable encounters with other survivors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only things you can trust are your weapons and the allies by your side. <br>Conquer the abyss together.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683260/extras/67b35612fa577aa56c13197850d776d1.avif?t=1787821436\" alt=\"Project Rabbit is a next-gen hardcore PC action game blending high-risk  Extraction mechanics with deep Soul-like combat.   Reimagining Alice in Wonderland as an East-meets-West dark fantasy  enriched by a proven Webtoon IP, it builds a unique universe for global audiences.   Driven by meticulously balanced action and strategic looting,  it delivers unparalleled immersion and endless replayability,  aiming to set a new benchmark in the proven hardcore gaming market.\" width=1368 height=1058 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Follow Alice into the abyss.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Project Rabbit</i> is a multiplayer Soul-like action game that reimagines <i>Alice in Wonderland</i> as a dark fantasy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight, explore, and survive within the twisted abyss of time. Will you escape the madness, or be consumed by it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683260/extras/0bab360ae8a61abf1cbb1d1b593027b0.avif?t=1787821436\" width=1368 height=362 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>[Into the Abyss of Time]</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the power of dimensions collapsed, continents from different realms became entangled into a single world, and within the cracks between them, the “Abyss of Time” was born.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Abyss is a twisted world sealed away by the Blood Queen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within it wander beings that neither age nor die, trapped in an endless cycle of time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those who survived the darkness of the Abyss built the last refuge beneath a fading barrier of light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the barrier is slowly losing its power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, someone must once again step into the Abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you survive the madness consuming the Abyss of Time alongside Alice?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683260/extras/bc0e4bf6801e360d54ea93399d8d8dd1.avif?t=1787821436\" width=1368 height=362 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>[Forge Your Own Way to Fight the Madness]</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within the Abyss of Time, even the smallest mistake can lead to a fatal end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use dodges, parries, and a variety of combat skills to battle against beings consumed by madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden treasures and forgotten secrets buried deep within the Abyss, and forge your own combat style through countless combinations of weapons, equipment, and skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683260/extras/93dbde4cb28fc4e0dd8fd6a46c66b36f.avif?t=1787821436\" width=1368 height=362 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>[Explore the Abyss Together — And Return Alive]</u></strong></p><p class=\